WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.920
[Please play table tennis with hands and legs tied up]

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.340
Otto might have a chance against me this time.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.380
I have to give him some handicap.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:06.980
That was good!

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.980
I can't believe that you get them back!

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.440
Yeah, but you need to be better than that!

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.960
Let's make it a bit more difficult for Miikka.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.580
I think we might see some falling over.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.880
This is definitely going to be more difficult!

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.420
Some footwork?

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:44.500
Yes, footwork!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:18.900
I almost made it!

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:42.620
This is really tough!

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:53.860
The tied up spin-around shot!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.940
I feel like a kangaroo!

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:13.920
Thanks for watching!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.660
Remember to subscribe to our channel here!

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.660
And watch our previous episodes there.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.600
Until next time!

